/scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_1610696490094841_410451601663953355_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=abjE5AIQJC0Q7kNvwF7-5pG&_nc_oc=AdpLLj3r_LUGDYQUWrTwzzDepE39Lumgb8wca3aZSUzEvOCcXwYZWv1p_JY_EKa-im0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOBnGUlNEv6EfWmoAM8FP8175w3Gd8rYxONUkBtVWE9xw&oe=6ADCBD92"}, "display_name": "DamnedSchool", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Magic. Puzzles. Action. Together in VR.**\nDive into a physics-based fantasy action shooter that pulls you straight into the adventure.\n\n- Face monstrous enemies up close with realistic physics\n- Unleash powerful spells\n- Explore mysterious places and solve ancient puzzles\n- Experience thrilling action solo or in co-op multiplayer with friends\n- Enjoy full immersion in a vibrant, interactive fantasy world\n\nFeel the power of magic, overcome the darkness \u2013 and embark on adventures only possible in VR.", "short_description": "Experience a physics-based VR fantasy shooter filled with magic, puzzles, and epic battles. Fight solo or in co-op, cast spells with your hands, and face monstrous enemies in a living fantasy world."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "titel_2560_1440logo.png", "id": "25353286670939764", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818874_25353286684273096_5729733783226815280_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KxAcbzXefyQQ7kNvwH3uotA&_nc_oc=Adqrh1h4a1QvU4OHr7Abt4g276P4vJVu7y9Y4b438Egjrvil3Bc2HlTIGq_Fusb8kUE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOTds8_yItNDtcny9obgynGFXB4nhYAE-PTWhoeql8RMg&oe=6ADCAF08"}, {"file_name": "symbolSolid512.png", "id": "2214463079017250", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819336_2214463082350583_1145808276885830663_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vjmquYyr_FgQ7kNvwHEtbqN&_nc_oc=AdrNAumALFWVECYOs6ZRCZNdcc